usiness page has error state with retry button - good pattern to copy.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## FINAL RECOMMENDATIONS FOR THE MAIN BUILD\\n\\n### What to Use Directly:\\n- All HTML structure patterns (two-panel, modal, card-grid, tabs)\\n- All CSS styling patterns (colors, spacing, animations)\\n- Button styling and states\\n- Form field styling\\n- Status badge system\\n- Card hover effects\\n- Modal animations\\n- Toast/notification patterns (if present)\\n\\n### What to Adapt:\\n- Voice recording UI (if not using voice)\\n- Loyalty program interface (adapt for your domain)\\n- Menu manager (adapt for your content types)\\n- Calendar view (if using appointments)\\n\\n### What to Build Fresh:\\n- Backend integration (all external JS modules)\\n- Real data loading\\n- API calls\\n- User authentication flows\\n- Payment processing\\n- File uploads\\n\\n### Missing Pieces:\\n- CSS files (need to create or link)\\n- JS modules (need to create)\\n- Image assets beyond placeholders\\n- Icon system (relies on Font Awesome CDN)\\n- Database models and schemas\\n- API endpoints\\n- Authentication/authorization logic\\n\\nThe **cleanest, most reusable piece** is the **voice call + voice notes + SMS automation complex**. These three pages together form a complete communication automation system that's well-designed and could be dropped into almost any SaaS platform."\}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":\{"input_tokens":5,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10138,"cache_read_input_tokens":114799,"cache_creation":\{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":10138,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0\},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"\}\},"requestId":"req_011CYaELXS5ngksDt6K3Lk8k","type":"assistant","uuid":"abc6829f-1512-4c8e-94a0-2eb7f4439e67","timestamp":"2026-02-28T09:29:53.044Z"\}\
