\pard\pardeftab720\sa52\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs26 \cf2 A public-facing voice-powered search engine where tourists find local businesses. "What's open for dinner near me?" - GCR answers with real-time availability, not just SEO listings. Currently 296 hand-coded HTML pages covering 85+ businesses across 181 categories. Needs to become database-driven and voice-enabled.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa304\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs30\fsmilli15210 \cf2 Product 3: NoShoes Media (The Influencer Network)\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa52\partightenfactor0

