\f1\b\fs39 \cf2 SUGGESTIONS & RECOMMENDATIONS\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa304\partightenfactor0

\fs30\fsmilli15210 \cf2 1. Don't Over-Complicate the Template System\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa52\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs26 \cf2 You don't need React or Next.js. Your current approach works: static HTML templates that fetch everything from the API. The beachside-site already does this perfectly. Just make the subdomain configurable and you have a scalable template system.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa304\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs30\fsmilli15210 \cf2 2. The Dashboard IS the Killer Feature\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa52\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs26 \cf2 Your beachside-dashboard with 28 modules is genuinely impressive for a V1. Most SaaS platforms launch with 5-6 features. You have full booking, CRM, waivers, waitlist, reviews, SMS, coupons, staff management, site editor, theme customization, domain management, and more. Don't undervalue what's built.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa304\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs30\fsmilli15210 \cf2 3. Prioritize the "Wow" Moment for New Businesses\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa52\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs26 \cf2 When a business signs up, within 5 minutes they should have:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls35\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
A live website with their name, hours, and phone number\
\ls35\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
A linktree page they can share immediately\
\ls35\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
A booking system if they're a rental/restaurant/service business That's your competitive advantage over WordPress - zero config time.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa304\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs30\fsmilli15210 \cf2 4. The 296 GCR Pages Are a Goldmine\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa52\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs26 \cf2 You have 85+ real Gulf Coast businesses with real data. When you migrate this to the database, you instantly have a populated search engine that demonstrates the platform's value. This is your customer acquisition channel.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa304\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs30\fsmilli15210 \cf2 5. NoShoes Is the Growth Engine\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa52\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs26 \cf2 Influencers bring businesses. Businesses bring customers. Customers generate data for AI. AI makes the platform better. This flywheel is what makes the platform defensible.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa304\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs30\fsmilli15210 \cf2 6. Don't Build Everything at Once\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa52\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs26 \cf2 Ship the beachside handoff tomorrow. Then ship the template system. Then ship GCR on the database. Each phase should be testable and deployable independently.\
