\f1\b\fs30\fsmilli15210 \cf2 Critical Mistakes to Avoid\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa52\partightenfactor0
\ls36\ilvl0
\fs26 \cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	1	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Don't try to build everything before launching.
\f0\b0  Ship the beachside handoff tomorrow. Ship the template system next week. Perfect is the enemy of good.\
\ls36\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	2	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Don't make the dashboard overwhelming.
\f0\b0  The beachside dashboard has 17 sidebar items. New users will be lost. Show 3-4 items on first login, unlock more as they set things up. Guided onboarding is crucial.\
\ls36\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	3	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Don't give away too much for free.
\f0\b0  The free tier should be USEFUL (linktree page) but LIMITED (no custom domain, no booking, no SMS). Make them upgrade naturally.\
\ls36\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	4	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Don't spread across too many markets too fast.
\f0\b0  Own the Gulf Coast first. 85 businesses in one area is more valuable than 5 businesses in 17 cities. Density matters for the search engine.\
\ls36\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	5	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Don't ignore mobile.
\f0\b0  80%+ of tourists will use GCR on their phones. 50%+ of business owners will check their dashboard on their phones. Mobile experience must be flawless.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa304\partightenfactor0

