\f1\b you're not building a website builder from scratch for every business
\f0\b0  - you're pulling their existing data and generating everything automatically. That's what makes this scalable. A new business goes from "I have a website" to "I have a full CyberCheck dashboard + hosted site + linktree + booking system" in minutes, not days.\
The booking platform scales because the data model is universal: 
\f1\b resource + time slot + customer = booking
\f0\b0 . Whether it's a boat, a table, a hair appointment, or a fishing charter - the database schema and API are the same. Only the UI labels change.\
